Re-cut on main: 625f5a6 (8 Oct) was handed over and never reached main.
Same change, right after the 47325 filter as on the branch.

Run f93fceab, 1 of 5 English lawyer answers: „Levan … is saved as a
lawyer.\n\nრამე სხვა გჭირდება ამასთან დაკავშირებით?" The writer's Georgian
voice slipped a whole closing line into an English conversation.

In a conversation that is not Georgian, a paragraph written almost entirely
in Georgian letters (3+ Georgian words, 80%+ of its letters) is dropped, as
long as the rest of the reply is in another script. Georgian names and labels
inside an English sentence, and lists that mix them with English words, stay.
A reply with nothing left in another script is untouched.

DONE WHEN: 5 English „Who do I have as a lawyer?" answers on fresh seats, none
with a Georgian sentence.

